cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Reinforced Iterative Classification (RIC)"
message: "If you use this software, please cite the paper below."
type: software
abstract: >-
  RIC formulates classification as a Markov decision process in which the action
  is a full class distribution, the reward is the stepwise improvement in log
  score, and a learned critic decides when refinement should stop. RIC-SPO trains
  this framework with Simple Policy Optimization.
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/kallel-mahdi/ric"

